{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2022-10-04 09:00:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL SELECTED BY MANGATA NETWORKS TO PROVIDE CONTROL SYSTEMS FOR NEW SATELLITE CONSTELLATIONS', 'text': "HONEYWELL SYSTEM ENABLES SEAMLESS CONNECTIVITY FOR USERS OF MANGATA'S 5G NETWORK PHOENIX , OCT. 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MANGATA NETWORKS, A SATELLITE TELECOMMUNICATIONS COMPANY, SELECTED HONEYWELL'S SPACE INTEGRATED ATTITUDE CONTROL SYSTEM (IACS)\xa0IN SUPPORT OF ITS NEW CONSTELLATIONS COMPRISING 32 SATELLITES. MANGATA'S NEW HIGHLY ELLIPTICAL ORBIT (HEO) AND MEDIUM EARTH ORBIT (MEO) SATELLITE CONSTELLATIONS PROVIDE COMMUNICATIONS AND WEATHER MONITORING IN AREAS THAT TYPICALLY LACK IN QUALITY INTERNET CONNECTIVITY."}